        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。",
      "start": 9.112,
      "duration": 1.524,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_002_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "周航，今天科技圈有几个事儿，我看完之后脑子一直是嗡嗡的，你给咱聊聊。",
      "start": 11.133,
      "duration": 6.008,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "行，你说。",
      "start": 17.594,
      "duration": 1.045,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "头一个，菲尔兹奖得主亲自下场搞大模型了。领衔团队用\"端侧4B Qwen加上云端GLM\"的协同架构，在那个号称抽象推理天花板的ARC-AGI 3上刷出了新成绩。",
      "start": 19.044,
      "duration": 17.87,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，这个事信息量挺大。菲尔兹奖是数学界的诺贝尔奖，最顶尖的纯数学大脑现在下场研究AI推理，说明什么？说明行业里的人都意识到，光靠堆参数这条路快走到头了。",
      "start": 37.347,
      "duration": 15.301,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，我看到4B这个数字的时候还愣了一下。4B就是40亿参数，现在大模型动不动上千亿，4B算个啥？",
      "start": 53.113,
      "duration": 9.97,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "问题是人家这个4B不是单兵作战，是跟云端的GLM协同干活。你可以这么理解——相当于一支小而精的特种部队在前线做侦察，把情报传给后方的指挥部做战略决策。",
      "start": 63.545,
      "duration": 14.561,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哈，这比喻好。我之前一直以为小模型就是给大模型搬砖头的，结果人家反过来了，小模型在前沿做抽象推理，云端做总指挥。",
      "start": 78.557,
      "duration": 11.059,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，而且端侧4B能直接跑在手机上，这意味着用户提问时能几乎零延迟拿到初步反馈，复杂的部分再丢给云端慢慢算。",
      "start": 90.116,
      "duration": 10.536,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听起来就像点外卖，手机上秒看菜单，后厨慢慢颠勺。",
      "start": 101.09,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，差不多。 这套架构真正牛的地方在于，它打破了\"大模型必须又大又重才能搞复杂推理\"的迷思，给行业指出了一条新路。",
      "start": 107.951,
      "duration": 9.796,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "而且那个团队提了个观点我特别想琢磨——\"拼参数不如拼架构与对齐\"。 这话分量有多重？",
      "start": 118.192,
      "duration": 8.882,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了，给整个行业泼了一盆清醒水。 过去两年大家都在卷参数、卷规模，结果人家告诉你，方向可能根本不是把模型做得更大，而是怎么让模型更聪明地协作、更精准地对齐人类意图。",
      "start": 127.548,
      "duration": 16.172,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，数学家视角介入也算开了新口子。 搞数学的最擅长什么？抽象推理、形式化证明，他们看推理问题的角度跟工程师完全不一样。",
      "start": 144.147,
      "duration": 12.844,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错，这种跨学科碰撞往往能催生真正的方法论革新， 不是小修小补。",
      "start": 157.455,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这事儿对咱们普通人有啥影响？",
      "start": 164.272,
      "duration": 2.264,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "短期内影响不大，但中长期看，如果这套架构跑通了，未来你手机里就能跑一个推理能力顶级的AI助手，不用什么都靠云端。 这对隐私、延迟、成本都是巨大利好。",
      "start": 166.972,
      "duration": 12.34,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说到AI for Science，再讲一个让我头皮发麻的—— DeepMind刚发布AlphaGenome Atlas。",
      "start": 179.729,
      "duration": 9.143,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "嗯，这个我也仔细看了。 简单说就是他们搞了一套系统，能预测人类全基因组里90亿个单字母DNA变异的分子效应。",
      "start": 189.368,
      "duration": 10.536,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，90亿这个数字我反复确认了好几遍。人类基因组大概30亿个碱基对，每个位置都可能变异，现在他们把几乎所有变异的效应都给预测了一遍。",
      "start": 200.316,
      "duration": 13.888,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，这事厉害在哪儿——过去研究基因变异功能，基本是\"个别已知位点\"的模式。研究人员盯着一两个致病基因反复做实验，一年能搞清楚几个位点就算高产。",
      "start": 214.683,
      "duration": 13.124,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那现在等于直接全基因组覆盖了？",
      "start": 228.239,
      "duration": 2.961,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，相当于从\"一盏灯照亮一个房间\"直接跳到\"整个城市夜景图\"。这种跃迁的工程量是惊人的。",
      "start": 231.668,
      "duration": 7.793,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太浪漫了。我脑子里画面是，科学家以前拿着放大镜一寸一寸找宝贝，现在AI直接把整个地球的矿产分布图给画出来了。",
      "start": 239.951,
      "duration": 11.276,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，你这比喻还挺形象。更重要的是这张图谱意味着遗传病诊断、药物靶点发现、精准医疗，全部有了一个全新的基础设施。",
      "start": 251.704,
      "duration": 11.189,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "比如说呢？",
      "start": 263.311,
      "duration": 1.001,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_027_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "比如罕见病孩子出生了，医生现在最快的方式是全基因组测序，跟这张图谱做比对，几分钟内就能告诉你哪些变异可能致病，不用一篇一篇翻论文。",
      "start": 264.751,
      "duration": 13.279,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "真的假的？这也太救命了。",
      "start": 278.442,
      "duration": 3.309,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "还有药物研发。以前找靶点靠运气，现在可以系统性扫描全基因组，看哪个变异跟疾病最相关，直接定位成药靶点。",
      "start": 282.244,
      "duration": 8.751,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，这事标志着什么？我感觉应该不只是技术进步这么简单。",
      "start": 291.404,
      "duration": 6.531,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你说得对，标志着AI for Science从\"单点突破\"进入了\"系统性建模\"新阶段。以前AI在科学里搞出成绩，往往是解决一个具体问题——预测蛋白质结构、识别某个天文现象。现在开始系统性地建模整个领域的基础设施。",
      "start": 298.422,
      "duration": 19.176,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听你这么一说，我突然觉得AI for Science这词被赋予了全新含义。以前是AI帮科学家干活，现在是AI在为整个学科搭建底层平台。",
      "start": 318.04,
      "duration": 13.584,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "是的，这个范式转变的深远影响，可能未来十年才会真正显现。",
      "start": 332.084,
      "duration": 5.181,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好，说完两个大新闻，再来几个有意思的快讯。第一个，阿里通义千问发了个新算法叫GSPO。",
      "start": 337.736,
      "duration": 8.882,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "GSPO全称是面向大模型强化学习的可扩展序列级优化。简单说，就是把强化学习用在训练大模型推理能力时，给出了一个全新的优化范式。",
      "start": 347.03,
      "duration": 13.148,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_036_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_036_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你能不能用人话翻译一下？",
      "start": 360.623,
      "duration": 2.177,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_037_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这么说吧，以前训练大模型做数学题、做代码题这种需要推理的任务，强化学习的优化方式是\"逐token打分\"，每生成一个词就立刻评价好不好。",
      "start": 363.255,
      "duration": 11.799,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_038_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那有啥问题？",
      "start": 375.494,
      "duration": 1.263,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_039_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "问题是这样太碎片化了。写代码或者解数学题，过程是一整个连贯的逻辑链条，你拆成token逐个评判，等于用放大镜看拼图，反而把整体逻辑打断了。",
      "start": 377.235,
      "duration": 12.321,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_040_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦，我明白了，GSPO是等整个序列生成完了再评判？",
      "start": 390.037,
      "duration": 6.531,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_041_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_041_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
